sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Customer
    participant G as gshop
    participant K as cart-service
    participant O as order-service
    participant I as inventory-service
    participant P as payment-service
    participant F as fulfilment-service
    participant N as notification-service

    C->>G: "Add to cart" on the catalog
    opt first item — no cart id in localStorage
        G->>K: POST /carts
        K-->>G: 201 {id} (stored in localStorage)
    end
    G->>K: POST /carts/{id}/items {sku, quantity}
    K-->>G: 200 {items}
    Note over G,K: repeated per add — the Cart screen reads<br/>GET /carts/{id} and +/- calls add / DELETE item
    C->>G: Checkout (items taken from the cart)
    C->>G: Fill checkout form<br/>(shipping, billing, card)
    G->>P: POST /payments/methods {card, billingAddress}
    P->>P: tokenize PAN (never stored)
    P-->>G: 201 {id, last4, brand, expiry}
    G->>O: POST /orders {items, shippingAddress, paymentMethodId}
    O->>O: validate request<br/>mint orderId + orderItemIds in memory<br/>(nothing persisted yet)
    loop for each line item
        O->>I: POST /inventorys/reservations {sku, qty, orderItemId}
        I-->>O: 200 reserved
    end
    O->>P: POST /payments/authorize {orderId, amountCents, paymentMethodId}
    P->>P: authorize via simulated provider
    P-->>O: 200 {authId, expiresAt}
    P--)F: payment-events: PaymentAuthorized {orderId, authId, expiresAt}
    O->>O: persist order + items (status = AUTHORIZED)<br/>in ONE transaction — first time the order exists
    O-->>G: 201 {status: authorized, shippingAddress, ...}
    G->>G: forget cart id (localStorage)<br/>cart expires in Redis by TTL
    F->>F: PENDING → PICKING → PACKED → DISPATCHED
    F--)O: fulfilment-events: DispatchConfirmed {orderId, trackingNo, items}
    F--)P: fulfilment-events: DispatchConfirmed
    F--)N: fulfilment-events: DispatchConfirmed
    O->>O: status = DISPATCHED
    N->>N: enqueue "your order shipped" email
    P->>P: capture (idempotency check on orderId)
    P--)O: payment-events: PaymentCaptured {orderId, amountCents}
    P--)N: payment-events: PaymentCaptured
    O->>O: status = CONFIRMED
    N->>N: enqueue receipt email
    C-->>G: poll/websocket status = CONFIRMED
